    intro="Agile for creative teams means managing design, content, video and brand work in small, visible pieces, with limits on how much is in progress and short, regular feedback loops. It suits creative work because good ideas already emerge by making something, showing it and refining it. This guide shows how to choose between Kanban and sprints, set up a creative board, control review rounds and measure flow, with two illustrative worked examples.",
